{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvTXklMjBMZWZ0JTIwRm9vdCUyMFRoZSUyMFN0b3J5JTIwb2YlMjBDaHJpc3R5JTIwQnJvd24lMjAlMjgxOTg5JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"My Left Foot The Story of Christy Brown","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/GRAAl0bMQFoFIjV3aunc5jsM5u.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zjKg04EquTcnVZUfjHboXnXzjcF.jpg","description":"No one expects much from Christy Brown, a boy with cerebral palsy born into a working-class Irish family. Though Christy is a spastic quadriplegic and essentially paralyzed, a miraculous event occurs when, at the age of 5, he demonstrates control of his left foot by using chalk to scrawl a word on the floor. With the help of his steely mother — and no shortage of grit and determination — Christy overcomes his infirmity to become a painter, poet and author.","releaseInfo":"1989","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.5","runtime":"103 min","cast":["Daniel Day-Lewis","Brenda Fricker","Alison Whelan","Kirsten Sheridan","Declan Croghan","Eanna MacLiam","Marie Conmee","Cyril Cusack"],"director":["Jim Sheridan"],"released":"1989-04-07T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"A film about life, laughter, and the occasional miracle.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Daniel Day-Lewis","character":"Christy Brown","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3kNA9VcmymoEwT0btQ4bvMYxzcP.jpg"},{"name":"Brenda Fricker","character":"Mrs. Brown","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qE1d7gjcH0dvrS5RViNmagCjb85.jpg"},{"name":"Alison Whelan","character":"Sheila"},{"name":"Kirsten Sheridan","character":"Sharon","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tgxwvotewbTyj18Eb2DAH2BkKcE.jpg"},{"name":"Declan Croghan","character":"Tom"},{"name":"Eanna MacLiam","character":"Benny","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jKVvMndeD9JMK0TNlc8Lg86hQx9.jpg"},{"name":"Marie Conmee","character":"Sadie"},{"name":"Cyril Cusack","character":"Lord Castlewelland","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w18